<title>GERMANY: Hoechst says posted pre-tax loss in Q4 96.</title>
<headline>Hoechst says posted pre-tax loss in Q4 96.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals and drugs group Hoechst AG said on Tuesday that special factors forced the group to post a 383 million mark pre-tax loss during the fourth quarter 1996.</p>
<p>A company spokesman added that without these special factors the group would have posted a profit in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
